# preseq 3.2.0: release README examples as honest upstream evidence
id: E999
draft: true
contributor_id: 2501_91199785
trigger_tool: make|autotools|conan
phase: testing
severity: 2
category: testing, autotools, release-archive, fixture-provenance
error_signature: "make check.*Nothing to be done|README.*fixture.*not found|No such file.*_read.txt"
match_keywords: "TESTS=0, check_PROGRAMS=0, make check, README example, fixture drift, release asset, preseq"
title: "无注册测试的 Autotools 发布包：枚举正式归档、校对 README 样例素材后执行可验证命令"
root_cause: "Autotools check 目标存在不等于有注册用例；README 示例可提供上游行为入口，但文档中的素材名可能与正式发布包漂移。直接报 make check 全过或复制不存在的素材名都不能证明功能。"
affected_scope: "含命令行示例和随包数据、但 Makefile.am 未声明 TESTS/check_PROGRAMS 的 C/C++ 发布包；不适用于上游另有独立测试框架而被配置条件关闭的情况。"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "enumerate-release-fixtures-and-run-documented-examples"
rec_description: "先枚举正式 release asset 中的 Makefile.am 测试变量与 data 文件；无注册用例则明确记录 0/0。逐项比对 README 的命令与实际素材，发现拼写漂移时仅修正调用路径，不改测试数据。运行全部可执行示例并断言输出文件非空且结构正确；安装后另做消费者测试，分开报告。"
rec_command: "tar -tf preseq-3.2.0.tar.gz | grep data/; grep -R 'TESTS\|check_PROGRAMS' Makefile.am; conan create . -pr:h=<ohos-profile> -pr:b=<ohos-profile>"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: "conan-recipe-and-test-manifest"
forbid_1_pattern: "make check.*100%|0/0.*100%"
forbid_1_reason: "零注册用例不能声称上游测试百分百通过。"
forbid_1_consequence: "测试覆盖率虚报。"
similar_to: "DRAFT-10251-libnfc-tools-1.8.0-autotools-test-framework-guard（条件排除已有用例）；DRAFT-ancient-2.3.0-autotools-tag-archive-bootstrap-test-recovery（git-archive 排除测试）"
